WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.920
(crowd stomping and clapping)

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.119
- Enjoy the show guys.

00:00:04.119 --> 00:00:05.216
- For sure.

00:00:05.706 --> 00:00:07.872
- Alright boys, let's focus up, okay?

00:00:08.442 --> 00:00:11.687
I say we start off the set
tonight with Rat Poison, alright,

00:00:11.687 --> 00:00:13.694
and then we end it with Pussy Thunder.

00:00:14.277 --> 00:00:16.239
- I just want to say, I'm
stoked to be here with you guys,

00:00:16.239 --> 00:00:17.644
right now, right here.

00:00:17.644 --> 00:00:19.391
- Fellas, you're on in five.

00:00:19.391 --> 00:00:20.546
- Thanks, Lou.

00:00:21.551 --> 00:00:22.852
- This is the big show.

00:00:22.852 --> 00:00:24.092
- Let's tear it up.

00:00:24.092 --> 00:00:25.362
- Bring it in.

00:00:26.663 --> 00:00:28.384
- No matter what happens--
- [Man in Glasses] Yeah.

00:00:28.384 --> 00:00:30.151
- [Woman] Let's remember
where we started, right here

00:00:30.161 --> 00:00:32.570
in this green room, as best friends.

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:37.491
(cheery folk music)

00:00:37.491 --> 00:00:38.797
- Rat Taxi.

00:00:39.447 --> 00:00:40.981
- Rat Taxi!

00:03:03.127 --> 00:03:08.110
(stomping and clapping)

00:03:12.094 --> 00:03:13.042
- Hi.

00:03:13.312 --> 00:03:14.490
- Oh, hey guys.

00:03:14.891 --> 00:03:16.435
- Sara.

00:03:16.435 --> 00:03:17.410
- Over here.

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:18.609
- We made a series.

00:03:18.609 --> 00:03:19.990
- It's coming on November 18th.

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:21.270
- Please watch it.

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:22.993
- Get it here, over here.
- [Sara] There.

00:03:22.993 --> 00:03:24.672
- [Woman Far Left] Over there, you got it.

00:03:24.672 --> 00:03:25.963
I think you got it, okay, I'm out.

00:03:25.963 --> 00:03:27.145
- [Sara] Okay Bye!

00:03:27.145 --> 00:03:30.019
It will be released 2015, November.

00:03:30.019 --> 00:03:30.846
- [Voiceover] Quinta!

00:03:30.846 --> 00:03:31.808
- Okay.

